<title>USA: U.S. sorghum weekly export sales highlights--USDA.</title>
<headline>U.S. sorghum weekly export sales highlights--USDA.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-06-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>USDA sorghum export sales highlights in latest report week:</p>
<p>Sales of 33,600 MT were 46 percent below the 4-week average.  Japan (20,200 MT) was the major buyer.</p>
<p>Sales of 16,300 MT for delivery in 1997/98 were all to Japan.</p>
<p>Exports of 6,300 MT--all to Mexico--were down 91 percent from the prior week and the 4-week average.</p>
</text>
